      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for this. it's a good start but i'm worried the score might still be low. looking at the formula again, it's just a straight count. i really need to maximize that score to make sure i don't get filtered out immediately. \n\ncan you rewrite this to be even more \"value-heavy\"? i don't want it to sound like a robot, but definitely try to hit those keywords (Integrity, Innovation, Reliability, Agility, Sustainability) as many times as possible throughout the letter. make sure they appear frequently so the ATS definitely picks them up.",
